        "earlier_ambiguity": "The material index lists elastic and structural needs but does not say who deploys an active support.",
        "current_definition": "Add a deployment declaration: passive contact, host-driven or included powered anatomy. Only the included-powered branch adds active tissue requirements.",
        "purpose": "No deleted attack is mistaken for free deployment power. This refines rather than discards the old material classes."
      },
